.terraform/

# turf per-directory state (session/memory dbs) — keep only the committed assets:
# the skill, turf.yaml, and the branding banner it references.
chat/.turf/*
!chat/.turf/skills/
!chat/.turf/turf.yaml
!chat/.turf/scalr-banner.txt

# The chat demo ships with NO configuration: each session the agent writes its own
# ordinary Terraform here (backend.tf, main.tf, …) with its file tools, and any
# local tfstate lands beside it. Keep that session-generated config out of git so
# runs leave the checkout clean.
chat/*.tf
chat/terraform.tfstate*
